## Special Instructions

### When Adding Dependencies:
1. Add to requirements.txt with version
2. Update README.md installation section
3. Test installation in clean environment
4. Document why dependency is needed

### When Changing Architecture:
1. Update docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
2. Consider backward compatibility
3. Update tests to match new structure
4. Update agents.md if significant

### When Improving Prompts:
1. Create backup of current version
2. Test with standard test set (short, medium, long videos)
3. Compare output quality
4. Document changes in commit message

